Storage Tier Analysis - Multi-Factor Decision Logic
def _analyze_storage_tiers(self, project_id: int) -> List[Dict]:
    # Hot tier: Modified OR accessed in last 30 days
    hot_query = db.query(...).filter(
        or_(
            FileMetadata.modified_date >= now - timedelta(days=30),
            FileMetadata.accessed_date >= now - timedelta(days=30)
        )
    )
    
    # Cool tier: 30-180 days, excluding Hot
    cool_query = db.query(...).filter(
        or_(
            and_(
                modified_date >= now - timedelta(days=180),
                modified_date < now - timedelta(days=30)
            ),
            and_(
                accessed_date >= now - timedelta(days=180),
                accessed_date < now - timedelta(days=30)
            )
        ),
        not_(or_(  # Exclude Hot tier files
            modified_date >= now - timedelta(days=30),
            accessed_date >= now - timedelta(days=30)
        ))
    )
Decision Tree:

File: example.txt
    └─ Modified: 2026-01-15 (6 days ago)
    └─ Accessed: 2025-06-01 (234 days ago)

Check Hot tier:
    Modified in last 30 days? YES (6 < 30)
    Accessed in last 30 days? NO
    Result: or() = TRUE → HOT TIER ✅

File: old_backup.zip
    └─ Modified: 2023-01-01 (1116 days ago)
    └─ Accessed: 2023-01-01 (1116 days ago)

