Alternative: Server-Sent Events (SSE)

@app.get('/analysis/stream/{project_id}')
async def stream_progress(project_id: int):
    async def event_generator():
        while True:
            summary = db.query(AnalysisSummary).get(project_id)
            yield f'data: {json.dumps(summary)}\n\n'
            if summary.status == 'completed':
                break
            await asyncio.sleep(2)
    
    return StreamingResponse(event_generator(), media_type='text/event-stream')
Why WebSocket over Polling?

Polling: 100 clients × 1 request/sec = 100 req/sec
WebSocket: 100 clients × 1 connection = minimal overhead
Real-time: No delay, instant updates"
